default: passes 2, failures 1
$assertpassoff: passes 0, failures 1
$assertpasson, $assertfailoff: passes 2, failures 0
$assertfailon, $assertvacuousoff: passes 1, failures 1
$assertpassoff, $assertnonvacuouson: passes 1, failures 1
$assertpasson: passes 2, failures 1
no control: a_later failures 1
$assertoff after go: a_later failures 1
$assertkill after go: a_later failures 0
